{"text": "To target 24 using the numbers [6, 7, 8, 10] exactly once with the operations +, -, *, /, we can use the following expression:", "start": 0, "end": 126, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 - 7) × (8 + 6) = 3 × 14 = 42 div 1.75 = 24", "start": 128, "end": 174, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "However, a simpler and direct approach using basic operations is:", "start": 176, "end": 241, "label": "inform"}
