{"text": "But lets simplify it to a straightforward expression:", "start": 318, "end": 371, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 + 6 - 7) × 8 = (16 - 7) × 8 = 9 × 8 = 72 div 3 = 24", "start": 373, "end": 428, "label": "inform"}
