{"text": "Correct and simplest way is:", "start": 871, "end": 899, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 + 6 - 7) × 4 = 9 × 4 = 36 / 1.5 = 24", "start": 901, "end": 941, "label": "inform"}
